        </Header>
        <Snippet>
            <Code Language="csharp"><![CDATA[public static T ModPower<T>(T @base, T exp, T mod) where T : IBinaryInteger<T>
{
    if (exp < T.Zero)
        throw new ArgumentOutOfRangeException(nameof(exp), "Negative exponent not supported.");
